  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://www.ontologydesignpatterns.org/ont/dul/DUL.owl#isComponentOf">
    <rdfs:comment>The hasPart relation without transitivity, holding between an Object (the system) and another (the component), and assuming a Design that structures the Object.</rdfs:comment>
